      "html": "<section class=\"slide slide-white\" id=\"slide-5\"><div class=\"slide-header center-stack\"><span class=\"header-mark\"></span><h2 class=\"header-title\">判断を先に、詳しい相談は後で</h2><p class=\"header-sub\">相談の詳細は、必要な人だけで続ける</p></div><div class=\"slide-body\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><div style=\"width:min(100%,var(--deck-safe-width));margin:0 auto\"><div class=\"step-flow-grid reveal\"><div class=\"step-card step-card-1\"><div class=\"step-icon\">{{icon:file-text}}</div><div class=\"step-num\">01</div><div class=\"step-title\">準備</div><div class=\"step-desc\">議題をメモで共有。</div></div><div class=\"step-flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div><div class=\"step-card step-card-2\"><div class=\"step-icon\">{{icon:check-circle}}</div><div class=\"step-num\">02</div><div class=\"step-title\">判断</div><div class=\"step-desc\">必要な選択を決定。</div></div><div class=\"step-flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div><div class=\"step-card step-card-3\"><div class=\"step-icon\">{{icon:message-circle}}</div><div class=\"step-num\">03</div><div class=\"step-title\">相談</div><div class=\"step-desc\">相手と次の行動を<br>決める。</div></div><div class=\"step-flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div><div class=\"step-card step-card-4\"><div class=\"step-icon\">{{icon:edit}}</div><div class=\"step-num\">04</div><div class=\"step-title\">記録</div><div class=\"step-desc\">担当と次の一手を<br>残す。</div></div></div></div></div></section>",
